<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Charterhouse lifts Safeway.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Charterhouse lifts Safeway.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Earnings estimates for Safeway Plc were raised at Charterhouse Tilney, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>For the year ending March 1997, Charterhouse raised its pre-tax profit estimate by 10 million stg to 445 million, sources said, reflecting recent signs of an easing of the petrol price war.</p>
<p>The stock was up 5-1/2p at 355-1/2 by 1116 GMT.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately avaialble for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
